1
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,399
So this is disco!

2
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:53,859
Pretty interesting.

3
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,340
First time here, Zhuzi?

4
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:58,619
No need to be nervous.

5
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:01,039
Because this disco thing...

6
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,880
your pal Mr. Chen Daguang knows his stuff.

7
00:01:04,459 --> 00:01:05,239
It's simple.

8
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:06,879
Shake to the left,

9
00:01:07,819 --> 00:01:09,120
sway to the right,

10
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:13,079
who cares what tomorrow brings!

11
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:16,599
Beats drop, chest tingles,

12
00:01:17,099 --> 00:01:20,180
shake all your worries away!

13
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:21,379
Come on, come on!

14
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:21,939
No, not like that.

15
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,140
What? What then?

16
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,659
When the beat drops!

17
00:01:25,819 --> 00:01:26,760
When the beat drops!

18
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:28,319
You gotta shake your hips! Shake 'em!

19
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:30,040
Beats drop!

20
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:31,620
Chest tingles!

21
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,599
Tingles where? Where?

22
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:33,459
You look like a baboon!

23
00:01:33,459 --> 00:01:34,780
All your worries...

24
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,739
Chest tingles!

25
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,540
Chest tingles!

26
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:40,280
Don't laugh! You laughing?

27
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,819
Think you can do it? You try!

28
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:43,239
I can! Of course I can!

29
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,040
Back then, Xiuer and I...

30
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,359
went to a dance at the Cultural Palace!

31
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:46,620
I can even do a backbend!

32
00:01:47,739 --> 00:01:48,459
Impressive!

33
00:01:48,540 --> 00:01:49,299
Really impressive!

34
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:51,019
Come on, join them!

35
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:52,760
Together! Come on, let's go!

36
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:48,620
Did it stop?

37
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:50,180
Why's everyone leaving?

38
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:51,000
They're changing the song.

39
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,800
Wh-What's wrong, girl?

40
00:04:25,980 --> 00:04:26,420
Mister...

41
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:29,360
Drinking alone is no fun.

42
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,399
Dance with me for a bit.

43
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:33,740
Well...

44
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,839
Dancing...

45
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:39,660
Mister...

46
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,199
I don't know how to dance.

47
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:43,300
It's my first time in a place like this.

48
00:04:43,819 --> 00:04:44,600
I'm scared.

49
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:47,480
My brother back home needs tuition money.

50
00:04:48,579 --> 00:04:49,060
Mister...

51
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,519
You look like a good man.

52
00:04:52,579 --> 00:04:53,720
If that's how it is,

53
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,720
now I get it.

54
00:04:55,279 --> 00:04:57,300
I was wondering why I'm so charming today.

55
00:04:58,019 --> 00:04:59,740
Turns out you're here to talk business.

56
00:05:00,899 --> 00:05:01,879
What are you saying, mister?

57
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:02,959
I'm saying,

58
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:05,620
do you have a gambling dad,

59
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,639
a sick mom,

60
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:07,959
a brother who dropped out,

61
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,040
and a broken home?

62
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,180
I know this routine all too well.

63
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:12,959
But look,

64
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,040
you've got to pace yourself.

65
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:17,420
String it out bit by bit.

66
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:18,120
With this approach of yours,

67
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:20,000
spilling it all at once ruins the act.

68
00:05:23,339 --> 00:05:23,759
N-No...

69
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:24,860
It's nothing.

70
00:05:25,699 --> 00:05:26,360
I'm sorry, mister.

71
00:05:58,540 --> 00:05:59,319
Why aren't you out having fun?

72
00:05:59,579 --> 00:06:00,120
Where's the other one?

73
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:03,980
What's wrong?

74
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,600
You upset?

75
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:39,300
Are you at a funeral or on a blind date?

76
00:06:39,579 --> 00:06:41,959
Did we bring you here to play sweethearts?

77
00:06:42,259 --> 00:06:42,899
Get it?

78
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:44,639
Your eyes gotta be alluring,

79
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:46,420
and that smile's gotta hook 'em.

80
00:06:47,579 --> 00:06:49,980
Acting so timid, how'll you make cash?

81
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:52,079
You gonna live on thin air?

82
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,480
I'll starve on thin air too!

83
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,139
Brother Biao,

84
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,360
Sister Hong,

85
00:06:58,860 --> 00:07:01,160
I came here just to be a waitress.

86
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:01,800
I...

87
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:04,639
I can serve tea, pour water, anything.

88
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:07,459
If worse comes to worst, I can dance too.

89
00:07:08,019 --> 00:07:09,660
But I really can't do anything else.

90
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:10,720
I just can't do it.

91
00:07:12,939 --> 00:07:13,540
Xiuer,

92
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,759
what're you so nervous about?

93
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,939
I'm not asking you to kill or set fires.

94
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,300
It's just what men and women do.

95
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,819
You'll have to go through it eventually.

96
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:23,139
Think of it as an early practice run.

97
00:07:23,779 --> 00:07:25,120
It beats getting fooled later

98
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:27,360
by a Greenhorn who won't treat you right.

99
00:07:29,100 --> 00:07:29,779
Sister,

100
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,180
I still have to work at the factory.

101
00:07:32,939 --> 00:07:34,860
If I run into someone I know,

102
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:37,459
how could I ever hold my head up again?

103
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:40,100
Xiuer,

104
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,079
didn't I tell you?

105
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,980
What era is this now?

106
00:07:44,379 --> 00:07:45,699
It's a market economy!

107
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,639
Holding cash right in your own hands...

108
00:07:47,779 --> 00:07:49,240
isn't that the most reassuring thing?

109
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:50,800
Besides,

110
00:07:50,939 --> 00:07:52,160
people love to wag their tongues.

111
00:07:52,220 --> 00:07:53,220
Let them talk!

112
00:07:53,439 --> 00:07:54,920
Talk isn't gonna take a piece out of you.

113
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,680
No, Sister...

114
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,120
Is there any other work here?

115
00:07:59,259 --> 00:08:00,339
I can clean up,

116
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,860
wash the dishes and the plates,

117
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,560
I can do all of that.

118
00:08:02,759 --> 00:08:04,079
I'll even take less money.

119
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:04,939
It's just...

120
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,500
I really can't do anything else!

121
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:07,579
Hong'er,

122
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:10,319
look how you've frightened the poor girl.

123
00:08:13,819 --> 00:08:14,399
Xiuer,

124
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:16,120
your Brother Biao

125
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:18,060
isn't an unreasonable man.

126
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,220
How about this?

127
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,480
I'll give you an easy way out.

128
00:08:22,259 --> 00:08:24,100
When you hit the dance floor,

129
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:26,000
keep your eyes peeled.

130
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:28,879
Pick someone who looks rich,

131
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,560
a real Greenhorn who cares about his pride.

132
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,120
Cozy up to him.

133
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,899
Talk to him about life and your dreams.

134
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,600
Tell him how rough your life has been.

135
00:08:37,539 --> 00:08:38,039
That way,

136
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:39,899
once you've gotten his head spinning,

137
00:08:40,379 --> 00:08:41,480
take him outside to talk.

138
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:42,519
You get me?

139
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,059
As for what comes next,

140
00:08:45,259 --> 00:08:46,440
you won't have to worry about a thing.

141
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,940
Our boys will rush right in

142
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:50,019
and catch him red-handed.

143
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:51,940
Doing it like this,

144
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,539
you won't actually lose a thing.

145
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,259
Easy and painless.

146
00:08:55,419 --> 00:08:56,000
What do you say?

147
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:59,779
I can't do that, Brother.

148
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,039
Th-That's against the law!

149
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:10,340
Xiuer,

150
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:15,039
you're standing here with me

151
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:17,659
and trying to play the saint?

152
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,519
I wanted us to be straight up,

153
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:24,299
and you're acting like some pure angel?

154
00:09:29,299 --> 00:09:30,879
Sister, please don't be mad.

155
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:31,679
I... I...

156
00:09:31,799 --> 00:09:32,899
I really can't do this.

157
00:09:33,059 --> 00:09:34,120
Please just let me go.

158
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:39,919
Coming and going as you please?

159
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:41,860
You think my place is a public toilet?

160
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,419
You've been here about a month now.

161
00:09:45,799 --> 00:09:47,899
Making two or three yuan a day adds up.

162
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:49,759
Your clothes, your jewelry...

163
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:51,080
Did I shortchange you on anything?

164
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,539
I'll pay it back. I'll pay you all of it!

165
00:09:54,980 --> 00:09:55,460
Fine.

166
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:56,519
Then let's do the math.

167
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:59,039
From head to toe,

168
00:09:59,580 --> 00:10:00,340
all added up,

169
00:10:01,419 --> 00:10:02,679
that's at least over 300 yuan.

170
00:10:03,379 --> 00:10:04,299
That's impossible!

171
00:10:04,419 --> 00:10:05,980
I only took a few dozen in total!

172
00:10:06,019 --> 00:10:06,820
A few dozen?

173
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:09,639
You think keeping someone like you

174
00:10:09,779 --> 00:10:11,600
comes that cheap?

175
00:10:13,799 --> 00:10:16,419
There's a lot more to it than that.

176
00:10:19,639 --> 00:10:20,139
Hong'er,

177
00:10:21,019 --> 00:10:23,059
let me talk some sense into her myself.

178
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,480
Xiuer...

179
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,179
Since you can't pay back the money,

180
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:35,960
just stay here and work for me quietly.

181
00:10:39,919 --> 00:10:41,460
If you're really that shy,

182
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,940
I don't mind taking the trouble.

183
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:46,879
I'll break you in tonight myself.

184
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,460
Once you see how good it feels,

185
00:10:52,039 --> 00:10:53,039
you'll naturally

186
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:54,799
get the hang of it.

187
00:10:58,799 --> 00:10:59,779
Xiuer, don't run!

188
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:05,360
Xiuer, stop running!

189
00:11:14,539 --> 00:11:15,120
Xiuer!

190
00:11:15,620 --> 00:11:16,179
Mengmeng!

191
00:11:17,019 --> 00:11:17,740
What's wrong?

192
00:11:18,259 --> 00:11:19,100
Th-They...

193
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:20,360
They're monsters!

194
00:11:20,899 --> 00:11:21,700
We're closed! Get out!

195
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,759
We're closed for the day!

196
00:11:22,919 --> 00:11:23,399
Clear out!

197
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,779
What happened?

198
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,860
Move it, get out of here!

199
00:11:25,899 --> 00:11:27,700
Sister Hong tricked me into waitressing,

200
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:30,360
but they actually wanted me to do that!

201
00:11:30,860 --> 00:11:33,720
They wanted my help to shake people down!

202
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,379
What are those guys doing?

203
00:11:37,419 --> 00:11:38,019
Hurry, hurry!

204
00:11:38,179 --> 00:11:38,840
Let's go, stop staring!

205
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,860
Get up! Move, move, move!

206
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:41,220
What are you looking at? Let's go!

207
00:11:42,539 --> 00:11:43,080
Don't move!

208
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:44,480
Bro.

209
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:45,519
Should we step in?

210
00:11:47,179 --> 00:11:47,919
What's the rush?

211
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,080
Just enjoy the show.

212
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,200
Who are these people?

213
00:11:57,139 --> 00:11:58,179
What a coincidence.

214
00:11:58,539 --> 00:12:00,759
They're coworkers from our old factory.

215
00:12:02,179 --> 00:12:03,700
The working class, huh?

216
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:05,200
Sister Hong.

217
00:12:06,340 --> 00:12:07,080
We used to work together.

218
00:12:08,019 --> 00:12:09,320
How could you do something like this?

219
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,000
Coworkers?

220
00:12:12,460 --> 00:12:13,700
What are coworkers worth?

221
00:12:14,659 --> 00:12:15,860
She eats my food and wears my clothes!

222
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:16,820
She owes me over 300 yuan!

223
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:17,740
Who's gonna pay it back for her?

224
00:12:17,899 --> 00:12:19,440
You tricked me into all of that!

225
00:12:19,759 --> 00:12:21,120
Either pay her debt,

226
00:12:22,019 --> 00:12:23,480
or get the hell out of here!

227
00:12:24,519 --> 00:12:26,720
You do vile things and act so righteous?

228
00:12:26,820 --> 00:12:28,259
Who the hell do you think you are?

229
00:12:28,419 --> 00:12:29,700
Do you know where you are?

230
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:31,799
Where is this, then?

231
00:12:32,059 --> 00:12:32,779
So completely lawless!

232
00:12:32,899 --> 00:12:34,019
Nobody can touch you, is that it?

233
00:12:34,379 --> 00:12:35,779
If you won't pay her debt,

234
00:12:35,820 --> 00:12:36,639
then get the hell out!

235
00:12:36,779 --> 00:12:37,200
Get over here!

236
00:12:38,019 --> 00:12:38,559
Stay back!

237
00:12:41,159 --> 00:12:42,000
Boss! Boss! Boss!

238
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:42,879
Are you okay, Brother Biao?

239
00:12:43,100 --> 00:12:43,700
I'm fine.

240
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:46,240
You little bitch Zhou Meng, you crazy?!

241
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:48,519
You dare make trouble on my turf?!

242
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:49,500
Get them!

243
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:50,299
Kick their asses!

244
00:12:59,179 --> 00:12:59,639
Come on.

245
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:00,879
Come at me!

246
00:13:01,039 --> 00:13:01,759
Get him!

247
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:03,879
Who do you run with?

248
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:05,600
Acting tough on my turf?

249
00:13:07,980 --> 00:13:09,139
Seriously, why do guys like you

250
00:13:09,259 --> 00:13:10,700
always ask the same damn question?

251
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,259
If you can't beat me, just admit it.

252
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:13,759
Who cares who I run with?

253
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:14,759
What, if I drop a name,

254
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:15,720
you think you can suddenly take me?

255
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,240
Are you blind? Get him!

256
00:13:18,399 --> 00:13:19,340
Take him down together!

257
00:13:21,039 --> 00:13:21,480
You go!

258
00:13:22,279 --> 00:13:23,259
You go! Get him!

259
00:13:24,399 --> 00:13:25,419
Xiaodong, you go!

260
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:26,840
Did I feed you for nothing?

261
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:27,820
Why should I?

262
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:28,779
What do you mean, why?

263
00:13:30,299 --> 00:13:31,720
You never treat me like a human being,

264
00:13:31,879 --> 00:13:33,039
now there's trouble, you want me to fight?

265
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:33,820
Why should I?

266
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:35,000
What do you mean, why?

267
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,480
Forgot how good Brother Biao treated you?

268
00:13:36,559 --> 00:13:37,759
You ungrateful dog, get over there!

269
00:13:38,419 --> 00:13:39,519
You're all bastards!

270
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,559
Sun Biao, you lied to me!

271
00:13:41,779 --> 00:13:43,379
You took my money and made me turn tricks!

272
00:13:43,700 --> 00:13:44,779
When I didn't get any, you beat me!

273
00:13:45,259 --> 00:13:46,679
You're not human, you're an animal!

274
00:13:46,779 --> 00:13:47,519
What the hell are you saying?

275
00:13:47,659 --> 00:13:48,379
And you!

276
00:13:48,679 --> 00:13:50,360
How many sisters have you ruined here?

277
00:13:50,700 --> 00:13:51,360
Bullshit!

278
00:13:51,659 --> 00:13:52,639
They all did it voluntarily!

279
00:13:52,779 --> 00:13:53,720
Nobody forced anybody!

280
00:13:53,820 --> 00:13:54,720
Cut the crap!

281
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:55,240
Let me tell you,

282
00:13:55,299 --> 00:13:56,559
neither of you is any good!

283
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:58,860
Every time shit goes down, I get beat up,

284
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,559
and the damages get taken out of my pay!

285
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:02,919
I didn't make a dime and even lost money!

286
00:14:03,039 --> 00:14:04,320
Bullshit! You're both full of shit!

287
00:14:04,460 --> 00:14:05,679
Trying to rebel against me now?

288
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,639
Are we gonna fight or what?

289
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,299
How about you settle your own business,

290
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,200
and I'll take a breather?

291
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:12,879
You little punk, stop right there!

292
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:15,159
Don't get cocky!

293
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,580
Do you know who my big brother is?

294
00:14:18,100 --> 00:14:19,100
Zhang Haoran!

295
00:14:19,879 --> 00:14:20,639
Cross him,

296
00:14:21,019 --> 00:14:22,340
and none of you will get away!

297
00:14:31,039 --> 00:14:32,480
I told you name-dropping wouldn't work.

298
00:14:32,779 --> 00:14:34,220
Your big brother ain't shit either.

299
00:14:35,539 --> 00:14:36,059
Zhuzi!

300
00:14:36,299 --> 00:14:37,740
His big brother is pretty tough.

301
00:14:42,399 --> 00:14:43,279
Eastern Tyrant.

302
00:14:45,460 --> 00:14:46,259
Who?

303
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:46,940
Shut up!

304
00:14:48,779 --> 00:14:49,779
Sun...

305
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,059
Sun Biao.

306
00:14:53,899 --> 00:14:55,759
You and your big brother are just alike.

307
00:14:56,039 --> 00:14:58,500
Nothing but lowlife flesh trade.

308
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:01,059
If I knew you forced women to turn tricks,

309
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,259
doing such dirty business,

310
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,220
I would've shut this place down long ago!

311
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,059
Brother Tian.

312
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,299
Is he your guy?

313
00:15:09,860 --> 00:15:10,559
Does he run with you?

314
00:15:11,059 --> 00:15:11,480
Look at that. See?

315
00:15:11,539 --> 00:15:12,340
Here we go again.

316
00:15:12,559 --> 00:15:14,100
Can't beat me, so you ask who I run with.

317
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:15,600
What, ran out of words?

318
00:15:18,519 --> 00:15:19,860
Well, this time you guessed wrong.

319
00:15:20,740 --> 00:15:22,840
This time, it's just your bad luck.

320
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:23,700
Sun Biao,

321
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:24,620
take a look behind you.

322
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,899
None of your boys even want to back you up.

323
00:15:27,580 --> 00:15:28,639
You've got no one to blame but yourself.

324
00:15:32,759 --> 00:15:33,360
Brother Tian,

325
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,080
I failed to recognize your greatness.

326
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:37,100
I was wrong today.

327
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:38,860
I didn't show you a good time.

328
00:15:39,559 --> 00:15:40,379
Next time for sure...

329
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,000
Did I say you could leave?
